  <data name="SettingsPage_KnotLinkCommandsBody.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>严格键值对协议：
cmd=get_capabilities
cmd=PING
cmd=LIST_CONFIGS
cmd=LIST_FOLDERS;config_id=ID
cmd=LIST_BACKUPS;config_id=ID;folder=%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%B9%E5%90%8D%E7%A7%B0
cmd=BACKUP;from=example.client;request_id=req-backup-001;config_id=ID;folder=%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%B9;comment=%E6%B3%A8%E9%87%8A;backup_mode=full;compression_method=zstd;compression_level=11;backup_blacklist=cache,logs;backup_whitelist=level.dat,region%2Fr.0.0.mca
cmd=BACKUP;from=example.client;request_id=req-backup-002;config_id=ID;folder=%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%B9;backup_scope=selected-regions;scope_dimensions=overworld,nether;scope_areas=0%2C0%2C511%2C511
cmd=RESTORE;from=example.client;request_id=req-restore-001;config_id=ID;folder=%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%B9;file=backup.7z;mode=clean;restore_whitelist=options.txt,playerdata
cmd=AUTO_BACKUP;from=example.client;request_id=req-auto-001;config_id=ID;folder=%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%B9;interval_minutes=10

MineRewind Plugin API v3 命令：
cmd=BACKUP;from=minebackup.mod;request_id=req-mr-backup-001;current_save=true;comment=QuickSave
cmd=LIST_BACKUPS;current_save=true
cmd=RESTORE;from=minebackup.mod;request_id=req-mr-restore-001;current_save=true
cmd=RESTORE;from=minebackup.mod;request_id=req-mr-restore-002;current_save=true;file=backup.7z;preserve_player_data=true

键名仅使用字母、数字和下划线；值必须 percent-encode；列表使用逗号分隔并逐项编码。未带 cmd 的旧协议请求会被拒绝。</value>
  </data>
